    <briefdescription>
<para>Illegal state for operation error. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcslt_1_1IllegalStateError" kindref="compound">IllegalStateError</ref> represents an error when an API call is not valid for the current state of the object.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Example Usage:</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keywordflow">throw</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/><ref refid="classcslt_1_1IllegalStateError_1ab483965644a53b333b44dbd74382f331" kindref="member">IllegalStateError</ref>();<sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>&quot;Illegal<sp/>state<sp/>for<sp/>operation&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
